%% title: Старт, тики и отмена шага плана через binding и AISystem
%% kind: sequence
%% level: детали
%% refs: BR-START, AB-REGISTRY, AS-START, AT-CLASS, AS-UPDATE, BR-SYNC, BR-CANCEL, AT-CANCEL
sequenceDiagram
  participant D as AIDecisionRuntime
  participant B as AIPlanExecutionBridge
  participant BR as AIActionBindingRegistry
  participant BI as IAIActionBinding
  participant S as AISystem
  participant T as AIActionTask
  participant R as IAIActionRuntime
  D->>B: StartReadyPlanStep(execution, bindings, aiSystem, world, agent)
  B->>BR: Find(step.actionId)
  BR-->>B: binding или nullptr (→ MarkCurrentStepStartFailed)
  B->>BI: CreateRuntime(context{agent, actionId, contextId})
  BI-->>B: unique_ptr runtime или nullptr (→ Failed)
  B->>S: StartAction(world, context, runtime)
  S->>S: CancelAction(agent) прежней задачи, erase
  S->>T: emplace AIActionTask(context, runtime) и Start()
  T->>R: Start(context) → Running / Succeeded / Failed
  S-->>B: статус (Failed/NotStarted/Cancelled → шаг Failed)
  Note over S,R: в этом же кадре aiSystem_.Update тикает Running-задачи
  S->>T: Tick(dt)
  T->>R: Tick(context, dt)
  D->>B: следующий update: SynchronizeRunningPlanStep
  B->>S: GetActionStatus(agent, actionId)
  Note over D,R: отмена: CancelPlanExecution → AISystem.CancelAction → AIActionTask.Cancel → R.Cancel (только если Running)
